  "title": "TRDP: Fix build on platforms where time_t is a long long",
  "description": "nstime.secs is a time_t, so the printf specfier %ld cannot necessarily\nbe used if the platform uses long long instead of long for a time_t,\nas some compilers will warn.\nThis describes, among others, MSYS2 for Windows.\n\nCast to intmax_t and use %ji instead.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
